  "description": "🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀\n\n🌩️ WELCOME TO THE TEMPEST GUILD!! 🌩️\n\n🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀\n\n🌩️ Here at tempest we prioritise  \nquality over quantity. 🌩️\n\n🌩️ We plan to take the game by\nstorm and become a top guild. 🌩️\n\n🌩️ We ask for daily participation\nand activity towards challenges. 🌩️\n\n🌩️ We wish to be a small group of\nindividuals that help each other \nout and help each member grow. 🌩️\n\n\n🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀\n\n🌩️ We are always looking for new \nguild friends, as well as some rivals! 🌩️\n\n🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀\n\nLeader • Quasar \nDeputy • Ellie\n🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀\n\n🌩️ THANK YOU ALL for reading this\nquickly put together description\nand let&#039;s hope you decide to come.\nWe look forward to building this guild\nwith all of you. 🌩\n\n🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀\n\nhttps://discord.gg/wyY7zEH5jm\n\n🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀🌀",
